WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.903
What I love most about Pittsburgh is just

2
00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:06.906
how many things there are to do
and to explore around the city.

3
00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:10.710
One of my favorite things to do on a
weekend is explore different restaurants.

4
00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:13.713
There always seems to be new ones
popping up every month.

5
00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:16.983
I also love attending various
sporting events and cheering on teams

6
00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:20.186
such as the Pittsburgh
Pirates, the Penguins and the Steelers.

7
00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:22.355
Pittsburgh also has so many great museums

8
00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:25.358
that I'm able to explore for free
using my CMU ID.

9
00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:29.429
My personal favorite is Andy Warhol
Museum, who just happens to be a CMU alum.

